sCinema(oBarkley,"dialog","Harriet, I want to thank you for bringing us out here.",1);
sCinema(oBarkley,"dialog","Harriet Tubman:\\I don't know why you're thanking me, mister. This place is as close to hell as you can get without being there. Not too many people live here and the ones that are here are only here because they've got nowhere else to go... but I don't think you're like those people.");
sCinema(oBarkley,"dialog","Harriet... Thanks.",1);
sCinema(oBarkley,"dialog","Harriet Tubman:\\Be careful... and take care of your son.");
